## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design cross-region, multi-account deployments with feature flags, observability-driven rollbacks, and a DR plan for serverless workloads.

## Key Concepts
- AWS AppConfig feature flags per tenant
- Cross-account IAM trust and least privilege
- GitHub Actions + CDK for multi-region deployment
- Route 53 latency-based routing
- AWS Synthetics for canary validation
- CloudWatch alarms driving automated rollback
- DR runbook integration

